  "prefLabel": "Ph 1101.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-01-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1101.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement and regulate collaborative pharmacy practice as a means to make the provision of certain aspects of health care more efficient, less costly, and provided in a more timely manner.\n\nSource. #9381, eff 1-31-09, EXPIRED: 1-31-17\n\nNew. #12464, eff 1-23-18",
